Description:

JMAP now has Identity/set (RFC 8621 Section 6.3), answering as the stub
Identity it serves allows: the user's one Identity cannot be created,
changed or destroyed.  A create is forbidden; an update that changes a
mutable property is forbidden, one that changes an immutable or server-set
property is invalidProperties, and one that changes nothing succeeds; a
destroy is forbidden (its mayDelete is false); any other id is notFound.
Until now Identity/set was an unknownMethod error.


